 ],
 "script": "[curious] You get enquiries... but most of them never turn into clients. Sound familiar?\n[seriously] Here's the thing. It's often not your price. It's your SPEED.\nThink about it. When you need a plumber, you message three of them. Who gets the job? [laughs] Usually the one who replies first.\nHarvard Business Review looked into this. Businesses that reply within an hour are far more likely to win the customer.\n[sighs] But you can't sit by your phone all day. So let a simple system do it.\n[confidently] When someone fills in your form... they instantly get a friendly email with your booking link. They get a quick text saying you'll call them soon. And YOU get an alert... so you can call while they're still interested.\n[warmly] You don't have to be faster. Your system does.\nSave this... and follow. Next week, I'll show you the cheap tools that do it."
